{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:bc5b48d1de00c9bd","name":"DP20 Corellian Frigate","source":{"id":"source:reference-bc5b48d1de00c9bd","title":"DP20 Corellian Frigate","revision":18690,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:33:47Z","sha256":"7b47098c7f6a089fa5382aff1b390c1f917a66e9d895718332c7ec325d1c8eac","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18690","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=DP20%20Corellian%20Frigate&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-bc5b48d1de00c9bd","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Corellian Gunship is the common name applied to a series of closely related ship designs (the most common being the DP20 Frigate) built by the Corellian Engineering Corporation from the last decades of the Republic through the time of the Yuuzhan Vong Invasion. A departure from most CEC designs, the Corellian Gunship is not modular, not easily modified, and not meant to carry a significant number of passengers or a large cargo load. It is a small ",{"tag":"a","children":["Capital Ship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Capital_Ship"}," designed to deal with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighters","referenceId":"reference:e127af2636e147fc"}," and armed ",{"tag":"a","children":["Space Transports"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Space_Transports","referenceId":"reference:082a04e1f80578b3"},". Originally built for use by the Republic Navy, the gunship soon found itself popular with merchant companies, wealthy travelers, planetary defense forces, and pirates.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Capabilities"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["The DP20 Corellian Frigate is primarily an escort vessel, designed to protect bulk cargo carriers from attacks by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighters","referenceId":"reference:e127af2636e147fc"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Space Transports"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Space_Transports","referenceId":"reference:082a04e1f80578b3"}," or to cover larger ",{"tag":"a","children":["Capital Ships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Capital_Ships","referenceId":"reference:a08d2e2cd508d403"}," from attacks by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighters","referenceId":"reference:e127af2636e147fc"},". Though it lacks long staying power and is often overwhelmed if acting alone, it has proven a useful part of many different fleet complements. Although unable to outlast larger dedicated military craft, the gunship has the firepower and defenses to engage such ships briefly.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Unlike most ",{"tag":"a","children":["Capital Ships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Capital_Ships","referenceId":"reference:a08d2e2cd508d403"},", the DP20 Corellian Frigate does not arrange its heaviest weapons to be fired in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Batteries"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Batteries"},". Instead, each Double ",{"tag":"a","children":["Turbolaser"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Turbolaser","referenceId":"reference:3f6c338dc202fcde"}," is controlled by an independent ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gunner"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gunner","referenceId":"reference:0cbc0bc5729f801f"}," with no ability to tie into the fire of the other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gunners"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gunners"},". This disconnected fire control allows the DP20 Corellian Frigate to carry a few extra heavy weapons, but it also means the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Turbolasers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Turbolasers"}," can't be fired in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Batteries"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Batteries"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Skilled)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["DP20 Corellian Frigate Statistics (CL 17)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Colossal (Frigate) ",{"tag":"a","children":["Capital Ship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Capital_Ship"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +0; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +6\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 16 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},": 12), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},": 39; +12 Armor, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicular Combat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicular_Combat","referenceId":"reference:31246426131b3457"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},": 920; ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Reduction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Reduction"},": 15; ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shield Rating"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shield_Rating"},": 115; ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"},": 139\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Offense"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Speed:"]}," Fly 12 Squares (",{"tag":"a","children":["Character Scale"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Character_Scale"},"), Fly 3 Squares (",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship Scale"],"href":"https://swse.mirahez